          ("(ii) $\\dfrac{DE}{BC} = \\dfrac{AD}{AB} = \\dfrac{2}{6}$, अतः $DE = 3$ m।", "(ii) $\\dfrac{DE}{BC} = \\dfrac{AD}{AB} = \\dfrac{2}{6}$, તેથી $DE = 3$ m."),
